Dear Professor,

I am writing to provide an update on the preparations for *Viwentiaa 2026*.
So far, our team has completed the initial planning, coordinated with the
respective student teams, and finalized several event-related tasks.

We have also started working on the event schedule, venue arrangements, and
promotional activities. Currently, we are focusing on completing the
remaining logistical arrangements and coordinating with the participating
teams.

We expect to complete the pending tasks before the event and will keep you
informed about any significant changes or requirements. Please let us know
if there are any additional tasks or areas that you would like us to
prioritize.

Thank you for your guidance and support.

Best regards,
*G. Meghana*
Organizing Committee Member
KLH Bachupally

